Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We had somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that we knew
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,very close,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and he was
