Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,sure he went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and after
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the testing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.35,0:00:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,there was something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,called Kennedy's disease
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,that he ended
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,up having.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kennedy's disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,because of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,his diagnosis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,they stopped the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,treatment for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the ALS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,literally planning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.81,0:00:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,his death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and he
